                                       <h1 style="color: #0d47a1; font-size: 30px;"><strong>How to Reschedule or Cancel NISM Series VIII Exam</strong></h1>
                                        <br />
                                       <p class="about-text" style="color:#000; text-align:justify; margin-top:10px;">
If you have already booked your NISM Series VIII Equity Derivatives Certification exam but are unable to appear on the scheduled date, you have the option to reschedule or cancel your exam slot through the official portal. The exam is conducted by the National Institute of Securities Markets under the regulatory framework of the Securities and Exchange Board of India, and all modifications must be done within the permitted time window.
It is important to understand that rescheduling and cancellation are time-sensitive actions. Delays or last-minute decisions can lead to additional charges or even loss of your exam fee. Therefore, you should act early, check available slots carefully, and complete the process through your candidate dashboard.
</p>


<h2 style="font-size:28px; color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">
Steps to Reschedule Your NISM Series VIII Exam Slot
</h2>

<p class="about-text" style="color:#000; text-align:justify; margin-top:10px;">
Rescheduling allows you to shift your exam to a more convenient date and time without losing your registration. This is useful if you need more preparation time or face scheduling conflicts.
</p>

<ul style="list-style:none; padding-left:0; color:#000; margin-top:10px;">
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Visit the certification portal of National Institute of Securities Markets</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Log in to your candidate account using your registered credentials</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Open the Candidate Dashboard</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Go to My Enrolments or My Certifications</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Locate your Series VIII Equity Derivatives Exam booking</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Click on View Details</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Select the option Reschedule Exam</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Check the available new dates and time slots</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Choose a suitable slot based on your convenience</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Confirm the rescheduling request</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Download or save the updated exam confirmation</li>
</ul>


<h2 style="font-size:28px; color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">
Steps to Cancel Your NISM Series VIII Exam Slot
</h2>

<p class="about-text" style="color:#000; text-align:justify; margin-top:10px;">
If you are unable to appear for the exam and do not wish to reschedule, you can cancel your booking through the portal. This step should be done carefully after reviewing the applicable refund rules.
</p>

<ul style="list-style:none; padding-left:0; color:#000; margin-top:10px;">
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Visit the official portal of National Institute of Securities Markets</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Log in to your candidate dashboard</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Navigate to My Enrolments or My Certifications</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Find your booked Series VIII exam</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Click on View Details</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Select the option Cancel Exam</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Confirm your cancellation request</li>
<li><span style="color:#0d47a1; font-weight:bold;">✔</span> Save the confirmation message or email for reference</li>
</ul>


<h2 style="font-size:28px; color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">
Important Rules and Timelines
</h2>

<p class="about-text" style="color:#000; text-align:justify; margin-top:10px;">
There are specific guidelines you must follow while rescheduling or cancelling your exam. Ignoring these can result in financial loss or inability to modify your booking.
Rescheduling or cancellation is allowed only before the scheduled exam date. Once the exam date has passed, no changes can be made. Rescheduling may involve additional charges depending on how close you are to the exam date. Cancellation and refund eligibility depend on the timelines defined by the National Institute of Securities Markets. Also, availability of new slots depends on whether you have selected a test centre exam or an online proctored mode.
</p>


<h2 style="font-size:28px; color:#0d47a1; margin-top:25px;">
Conclusion
</h2>

<p class="about-text" style="color:#000; text-align:justify; margin-top:10px;">
Rescheduling or cancelling your NISM Series VIII exam slot is a simple process when done through the official portal of the National Institute of Securities Markets. By logging in, accessing your exam details, and selecting the appropriate option, you can easily manage your schedule. The key is to act within the allowed time frame, review all conditions carefully, and secure a new slot if required without risking your exam fee.
</p>                                
